ver 900 audio feeds from airports across the U.S. and listen to controllers and pilots as things are happening\nEasily switch between all radio channels at an airport\nGet real-time transcripts of what the pilots and controllers are saying\nLowest broadcast delay in the industry, so you hear it first\n\nMAP VIEW\nRich, true-to-life airport maps with every runway marking and taxiway centerline\nAI auto-highlights the aircraft that’s talking, so you’re always aware of what’s happening\nSmooth and simple maps with live and historical weather effects\n\nINSTANT ALERTS\nGet alerts for interesting situations or emergencies as they’re happening, powered by specialized AI models\nBe the first to know — before social media, news, or even the government\nReplay interesting events right after they happen, or even as they’re unfolding\n\nFOLLOW AN AIRCRAFT\nTap on an aircraft to follow it — and you'll always be listening to the right channel for that aircraft\n\nEXPANDING COVERAGE\nThe ATC app covers more than 90 of the busiest airports across the United States\nNew airports are added each week\nAsk for coverage at your favorite airport, and we’ll try to add it soon\n\nSUBSCRIPTION PRICING \nATC is free to use for your first week. After the trial period, an auto-renewing monthly or annual subscription is required to continue accessing live audio, transcripts, and map features.", "averageUserRating": 5, "trackCensoredName": "ATC - Live Air Traffic Radio", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/atc-live-air-traffic-radio/id6755132266?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "9+", "artistId": 1838819917, "artistName": "Enhanced Radar", "userRatingCount": 7}]}